From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naushir Patuck <naush@raspberrypi.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:23:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] utils: version: Handle git not being installed

If git is not installed, subprocess.run() raises FileNotFoundError,
which was not caught. Catch OSError as well so a missing git is treated
like a non-git source tree.

Signed-off-by: Naushir Patuck <naush@raspberrypi.com>

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/raspberrypi/libpisp/commit/c77865739bbde5be918d5a7692c8a8050e0abc25
Applied-Upstream: c77865739bbde5be918d5a7692c8a8050e0abc25
---
 utils/version.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/utils/version.py b/utils/version.py
index 5fdec059025e..590f8ef389d5 100755
--- a/utils/version.py
+++ b/utils/version.py
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@ def generate_version():

         commit = f"v{sys.argv[1]} {commit}"

-    except RuntimeError:
+    except (RuntimeError, OSError):
         commit = f"v{sys.argv[1]}"

     finally:
